{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4543","id":4734411786,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU59Ms88AAAABGjFkCg","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4543","diff_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4543.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4543.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/issues/4543","number":4543,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SF-A29: fuzz native-host authorization and path containment","user":{"login":"wieslawsoltes","id":2297442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2297442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Task: SF-A29-T05.8\nRelated: #1150.\n\n## Behavior\nAdd a closed native-host mode to the network fuzz target using the actual loopback native-host handler. Each case owns its ephemeral listener, disposable workspace and outside sentinel. Fixed reviewed requests exercise valid access, bad or missing tokens, foreign Origin, encoded traversal and denied native-build execution.\n\nMutation bytes choose bounded cases and variants; they cannot provide destinations, host paths, commands or credentials. Requests, connections, headers, output and cleanup waits are bounded. The fixture verifies expected rejection statuses, workspace/sentinel integrity, no unauthorized process execution and closure of owned sockets, server and temporary roots. Unexpected errors remain findings.\n\nExisting pure NetworkPolicy/CSP checks remain available. Actual HttpTransport request/response streams are a separate already-tested follow-up batch.\n\n## Validation\n- 34 focused native-host and existing text-target tests passed.\n- Command: `node scripts/limited.js node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-reporter=tap tests/conformance/fuzz/native-host-target.test.js tests/conformance/fuzz/text-targets.test.js`.\n- Node 24.19.0, Linux x64; tested local commit `5f6d0664ba2f2f05d1705ec74a02b0bcd746f641`, tree `8c5b282b34c11679c8b132f89b074d060e6e1736`.\n- Published tree verified byte-identical; GitHub-created commit metadata differs. Independent source review passed.\n- Existing A29 manifest covers the new test. Ordinary core is static/build verification and does not execute Node tests.\n\nThis establishes the fixed local adapter cases. It does not claim all platform/native SDK qualification or arbitrary provider coverage; #1150 remains open.","created_at":"2026-10-04T12:37:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T12:39:30Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T12:39:29Z","merged_at":"2026-10-04T12:39:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"17db935b862a6a26fe39e41f2287ba3e620dc628","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":12526353617,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU59Ms88AAAAC6qD80Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/labels/size/L","name":"size/L","color":"A14C05","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4543/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls